{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07360","headline":"哭张员外继 · 刘长卿","name":"哭张员外继","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"恸哭锺陵下，东流与别离。\n二星来不返，双劒没相随。\n独继先贤传，谁刊有道碑。\n故园荒岘曲，旅榇寄天涯。\n白简曾连拜，沧洲每共思。\n抚孤怜齿穉，叹逝顾身衰。\n泉壤成终古，云山若在时。\n秋风邻笛发，寒日寝门悲。\n世难愁归路，家贫缓葬期。\n旧宾伤未散，夕临咽常迟。\n自此辞张邵，何由见戴逵。\n独闻山吏部，流涕访孤儿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07360.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07360","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}